SUMMARY:State of AI - Agentic UI (Livestream)
DESCRIPTION:Modern Web (Triangle)\n​Discover how AI is reshaping the way
  organizations build\, deploy\, and scale intelligent systems\, moving bey
 ond static tools toward more adaptive\, interactive experiences.\n\n​Joi
 n industry leaders including Mike Ryan\, Principal Architect at CopilotKit
 \, Dominik Kundel\, Developer Experience at OpenAI\, and Elliott Fouts\, C
 AIO & CTO at This Dot Labs as they explore the evolving landscape of AI-dr
 iven products. From emerging interface paradigms to systems that can act\,
  respond\, and collaborate more fluidly with users\, this conversation wil
 l touch on the shift toward more agent-like experiences in modern applicat
 ions.\n\n​We’re bringing together AI practitioners\, product leaders\,
  engineers\, and innovators to discuss real-world applications\, emerging 
 trends\, and the standards shaping what’s next. Expect thoughtful insigh
 ts into what’s working today\, where things are headed\, and how teams c
 an design more dynamic\, responsive AI systems.\n\n[RSVP using this link t
 o receive reminders!](https://luma.com/1thfunkv)
